  "voice": {
    "intro": "Emperor Taizu of Song, Zhao Kuangyin: one mutiny, and the Great Song opens.",
    "outro": "He began with a yellow robe at Chenqiao Post, then spent sixteen years cleaning up the wreckage of the Five Dynasties. Military power to the capital, fiscal power to the court, the south to Song. The candle-shadow and axe-sound mystery he left for later generations to debate—but the first candlestick of the Great Song's three hundred years was drawn by him.",
